## 💻 Features

| Function                 | Description                                    |
| ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------- |
| **Start/Pause (S/P)**    | Toggles the control loop on the MCU            |
| **Toggle Telemetry (T)** | Starts/stops CSV streaming from STM32          |
| **Switch Row (R<n>)**    | Selects DE5 parameter row                      |
| **Query (Q)**            | Displays current DE5 values                    |
| **Live Plot (--plot)**   | Optional real-time plot of current and voltage |
| **CSV Logging (--log)**  | Saves all telemetry to a timestamped file      |

